{#
  The assignment create form — the one page in this batch that is **not** simply its edit
  twin with a new heading.

  Three things differ, all of them in assignments/create.phtml rather than in the shared
  partial:

  - **Three assets the edit page does not load**: selectize's stylesheet, jQuery UI's, and
    `gen-validate-selectize.js`. The edit page loads none of them, which is why its template
    declares no asset blocks at all — the assignments partial appends nothing.
  - **A cascade script.** `roleId` is populated from `associationId` in the browser:
    `AssignmentForm::getRolesJson()` emits the whole association => roles map and the script
    rebuilds the role `<option>` list whenever the association changes. Without it the role
    select is empty until the page is reloaded, which is also why the controller's
    `?roleId=` prefill has to set the options itself.
  - **The script is minified**, through `jshrink` — the only page in the application that
    does. `minify_js` is the Twig counterpart; see App\Twig\ScriptExtension for why
    reproducing it matters to the baseline diff.

  No delete button and no confirmation modal: the edit page has both, and a record that does
  not exist yet cannot be deleted.

  The create page is the edit page with a different heading, a different action and no
  record — which is exactly what laminas says too: create.phtml and edit.phtml are separate
  view scripts that include the same fields-partial.phtml. So this template **extends its
  edit twin** and overrides only what differs. What that inherits is the page's assets and
  its inline scripts, which on laminas come from the shared partial rather than from either
  view script, so inheriting them is the faithful arrangement rather than a shortcut.
#}
{% extends 'schoenstatt/assignment-edit.html.twig' %}

{% block page_stylesheets %}
        <link href="/css/selectize.bootstrap3.css" media="screen" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
        <link href="/css/jquery-ui.min.css" media="screen" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
{% endblock %}

{% block page_scripts %}
        <script src="/js/gen-validate-selectize.js"></script>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<h1>{{ translate('Create New Assignment') }}</h1>

{{ form_open(form, form_action) }}
{{ include('schoenstatt/_assignment-fields.html.twig') }}
{{ form_submit(form.get('submit')) }}
{{ form_close() }}
{% endblock %}

{% block inline_scripts %}
<script nonce="{{ csp_nonce() }}">
{% apply minify_js %}
$(function() {
    var $associationId = $("select[name='associationId']");
    var roles = {{ form.getRolesJson()|raw }};
    var $roleSelect = $("select[name='roleId']");
    $associationId.change(function() {
        if ($associationId.val() !== '') {
            newOptions = roles[$associationId.val()];
            if($roleSelect.prop) {
              var options = $roleSelect.prop('options');
            }
            else {
              var options = $roleSelect.attr('options');
            }
            $('option', $roleSelect).remove();

            $.each(newOptions, function(val, text) {
                options[options.length] = new Option(text, val);
            });
        }
    })
});

$("select[name='personId']").selectize({
    create: false,
    sortField: 'text'
});
$("select[name='associationId']").selectize({
    create: false,
    sortField: 'text'
});
{% endapply %}
</script>
{% endblock %}
